WEBVTT

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:46.830
Shuurei!

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:10.880
Father...

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.010
Shuurei.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:20.360
Y-Yes?

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.080
You have work to do. Go.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:25.320
What?

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:26.190
Okay.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:35.630
Shuurei!

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:40.350
Thank you very much.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:45.820
Now go quickly!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.180
A bloodline gifted with supernatural powers, the Jingi...

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:00.280
What business does the head of the Hyou family have in Kiyou?

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:01.660
How much...

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:07.410
do you have to take away from me to be satisfied, Kou Shouka?

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.600
You've murdered countless members of my family.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.110
Shuusui!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:23.260
No, you don't have to do this. Stay back.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:25.540
Yes...

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.640
You took Shuusui and snatched away my Barahime.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.900
Yet you live at ease as if you were good-natured.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:41.140
As I might expect of the eldest Kou son, you left your good nature behind in your mother's body when you were born.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:47.280
I've lived a long time, but never have I met a man so typical of the Kou family.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.500
Do not show your face to my daughter ever again!

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.800
Just as before, you don't realize where you stand.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.360
You cannot kill me.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:06.420
Have you forgotten that you barely escaped with your life that time and had to escape to Kiyou?

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:11.390
Especially now that you've lost both Barahime and your youth, can you do it?

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:14.770
You couldn't finish me off either!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.810
You really don't change.

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:23.010
I've never hated anyone as much as you before or since, Kou Shouka.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:30.660
Even so, I thank you for letting me see my beloved Barahime again.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.080
That girl is not your Barahime!

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.080
I know.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:40.440
My Barahime was so beautiful that not even the moon could match her.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.620
Although Eiki and Shunki are descended from the Hyou Family,

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.110
they are nowhere near as beautiful.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.680
But that girl resembles her mother.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.100
Though she is not my Barahime,

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.360
now that I've found her,

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.600
I will take back what belongs to me.

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:59.610
What belongs to me, Shouka.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.510
I don't know why, but that man...

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.510
He didn't seem to be of this world.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.090
S-Seiran.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.440
My lady...

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.730
What's wrong?!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.670
Did something happen to you?

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.860
N-Nothing.

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.110
Something did happen, didn't it?

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.140
You're shaking!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.290
Well, Seiran, I...

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:57.160
Have you ever seen a family crest comprised of eight flower petals of different colors?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.830
Where did you see that?!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.010
Seiran?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.300
Where did you see it?!

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.000
Just now, I met...

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.610
You met?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.250
In this palace?!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.300
Yes, what's wrong, Seiran?

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.320
My lady, you met...

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.940
Did he do anything to you?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:27.500
It started to snow, so he tried to wrap his shawl around me.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.690
Was there a moon?

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:30.950
A moon?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.450
On the family crest, was there something like a moon?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:37.250
Come to think of it, there was a full moon on it.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.080
A full moon?

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:40.360
Seiran?

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:47.300
Something is bothering me a bit.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.300
I'll investigate that man.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.070
Will you keep quiet about this for now?

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.110
I will.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.690
The library has disappeared?!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:03.680
When was it relocated?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.690
No, it was still there yesterday...

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.280
Did the library grow wings and fly away?!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:12.530
Otherwise, how can I explain my failure to get to the library?!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:17.220
What... What is this? A dream? A nightmare?

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.870
I must be asleep!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.520
Ouch! This is reality.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.890
Am I going to search for the library until...

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:30.870
Argh! Is that what's going to happen to me?!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:31.440
Oh!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.080
Does Kouyuu-sama have business in the library too?

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:38.740
Shuurei...

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.340
Thank the gods.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.550
You must be tired, Kouyuu-sama.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.110
Yeah, sort of.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.620
Have you finished your work?

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.830
Y-Yeah, a miracle occurred.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.450
A miracle?

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.200
Y-Yes.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.340
Anyhow, thanks for all the hard work.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.350
Would you like some mandarins?

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.350
I brought them for a snack.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:20.850
Please.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:29.770
As I thought, Shuurei was behind the miracle that saved Civil Affairs.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:31.660
Kouyuu-sama?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:35.270
You know, Shuurei, you've become

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.200
quite a good person.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.030
Well, I will have some now.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.800
They appear to be top-quality fruit from Koushuu.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:49.100
The Kou family use a secret technique to develop them.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.610
They are quite rare.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:51.820
Is that so?

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:55.970
I wonder if it was okay to receive so many from a stranger.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:58.720
Take everything that's given to you.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.880
You're right. I'll take everything that's given.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.600
Take everything that's given...

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.730
No! What am I thinking?!

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.700
But if I were to marry Shuurei...

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:21.740
He's not going to cry like a wimp.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.750
Oh? Did you catch a cold, my Lord?

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.300
Er, no, I think someone is gossiping about me.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.360
Perhaps it's about the marriage proposals again?

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:43.390
Probably he would wish for our happiness.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.770
He must be prepared for something like that.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:48.270
Then again...

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.050
I'm not happy about it.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:53.530
Why?

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:05.830
Yes, that's it!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:09.810
I'm sure of it now. There <i>is</i> something wrong with Kouyuu-sama.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.170
Has he overworked himself?

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:14.630
I'm happy with things just as they are now.

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.620
One day, I may have to make a decision.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:27.340
But for now, it's just one of the possibilities for the future.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.070
Kouyuu-sama?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:34.070
I inadvertently thought I was facing a serious problem,

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.520
but that wasn't the case.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:40.650
Dear me, I nearly fell into Kurou-sama's trap!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.270
I'm a fortunate man!

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:47.310
I-I'm glad to hear that.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:59.150
Did I say out loud what I was thinking?

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:00.480
Yes.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.240
There's a possibility that the head of the Hyou family has contacted Shuurei?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:18.830
Yes.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.860
Why Shuurei?

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.270
I wonder...

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:33.750
Just in case, should we investigate the temples and residences in Kiyou that are associated with the Hyou family?

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:36.340
If Shuurei says she met him in the palace,

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:39.780
maybe he's lodging secretly somewhere nearby?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:44.260
My Lord, the matter is more pressing than that.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.860
Er, um, yes.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.270
The Hyou family...

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:50.870
They are dangerous.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.280
I have no idea what he's thinking,

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.990
but that man came all the way to Kiyou by himself.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:05.870
Send out spies to search for him and to report on his every move.

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:10.810
Yes, but... what did he come here for, really?

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:14.880
The head of the family came here, but I feel he's ignoring me completely.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:19.380
That's why I'm asking you to investigate him.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:23.630
Y-Yes, b-but...

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:27.130
will our spies be able to find him?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.260
In my father's time,

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:33.640
only the "Wolves of the Wind" could match them.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.610
Even then, I heard they had many losses.

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:39.640
Shuuei?

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.220
It will be difficult.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.740
The Hyou family has abandoned the political stage

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.050
and kept silent for decades.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:51.290
Currently, we have hardly any information on them.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.950
We'll do what we can, but...

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.600
Well, maybe the head of the Hyou family just felt like

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:02.710
coming to see Kiyou for a change.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.940
He's come so far.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:08.840
I'd like to meet him if I could, and also hear what his New Year's resolution was.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.600
It may be useless, but search for him just this once.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.160
Understood.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.360
Kouyuu-sama...

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.090
May I ask you a question?

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:22.860
What is it?

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:27.210
Well, suppose you're trying to advance an important agenda,

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.090
and you've asked for help and assistance from somewhere,

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:33.350
but they've rejected you, saying even talking is unnecessary.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.990
We won the negotiation with the Merchants Guild without having to fight them.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:38.930
Now we can return to Sashuu.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.420
What do you think it means by "won without having to fight"?

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.170
The Merchants Guild, huh?

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.480
W-Was it that obvious?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.430
How did you know?

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.390
Because if I were the Merchants Guild, I'd do the same.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:59.040
Nobody wants to be subjected to
Yuushun-sama's direct persuasion.

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:02.350
His negotiating skills are terrifying.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.990
You don't know what kind of conditions you'd end up accepting.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:09.250
Kouyuu-sama, I can wipe off the mandarin juice myself.

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:11.120
Don't worry about it.

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:17.830
To put it simply, the Merchants Guild avoided negotiating with Tei Yuushun face to face.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:25.770
Her hands are quite rough. I'd better fetch some hand cream for her later.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.630
But, if you weren't able to negotiate?

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.410
Don't worry.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.540
Yuushun-sama said you won without negotiation, right?

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:38.110
That means the Merchants Guild has given in,

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:39.640
no mistake about it.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.320
I suppose so...

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.310
Ah, Yuushun-san!

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.750
Sorry to disturb you.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.490
You were having a good time together.

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:06.000
Y-Yuushun-sama, would you like to eat some mandarins with us?

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.630
Er, well, thank you.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.930
Please, Yuushun-sama.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:19.590
P-Please keep this secret from Reishin-sama.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:29.110
So, why did you come here, Yuushun-sama?

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:34.270
Actually, Kai You, the governor of Kokushuu, has sent a post-horse.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:39.530
Governor Kai will arrive in Kiyou tomorrow morning.

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:42.750
Really? Now we hold all the cards!

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:46.420
We should invite him for dinner as soon as he arrives.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.320
No, that's not necessary.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.510
This is a letter from Governor Kai

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.010
to Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei-dono.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.640
What? To me?

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.360
When he arrives tomorrow, he would like to meet you as soon as possible.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:08.530
What does it mean that Governor Kai wants to meet me?

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.240
Please don't cr-

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:53.760
Why... Why are you being so kind to me now?

00:16:56.570 --> 00:17:01.750
When you're thinking of leaving me without a word...

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:09.980
No, don't come close to me. You... I don't care about you!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.700
You... I hate you!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:21.770
Please don't go...

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:27.270
I was thinking about going... without a word.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:28.700
Please.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.280
But, only to you-

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.390
Don't go anywhere!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.400
I want to tell you everything, and then I'll go.

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.600
You've met Yougetsu, right?

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.760
What is he?

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.800
The man who is taking your life away?

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:47.800
That's not right.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.970
Yougestu has given me life.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:59.180
My life should've ended long ago. Yougetsu extended it.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.120
Do you want to live?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.940
Since you were born,

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.830
your life has always been nothing but misery.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.620
I want to live.

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.290
Even I don't know what Yougetsu is.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:27.550
But from that moment, my body had become Yougetsu's.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:35.060
Yougetsu's soul is much stronger than my nearly extinguished soul.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:39.340
That's why I need Yougetsu to stay alive.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.680
But that... that's wrong!

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:49.840
It's as though some monster called Yougetsu is slowly taking you over, right?

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:50.700
Perhaps.

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:57.930
Even so, because of that monster, I've been able to live until now.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:03.530
The monster has waited as long as my soul could've lasted.

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:12.330
The night is over.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:16.090
How much longer... can you last?

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:25.180
The person who had half of my soul passed away the other day.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.790
I probably won't last another month.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:36.700
It's time for goodbye, Kourin-san.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.350
I must go to Sekiei village.

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:46.190
I must do what I can.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:51.040
Koringun needs as many doctors as possible right now.

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:58.090
Rather than waiting for Shuurei-san and facing my last moments here,

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:02.550
I'd like to choose a path whereby I save as many lives as I can.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:04.460
There must be a way...

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:08.000
Even if I disappear, Yougetsu will remain.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:11.230
I don't want Yougetsu-sama!

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:15.980
Thank you.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:18.250
I don't want this!

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:19.850
Not this...

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.800
I... love you.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.820
So, please forget about me and live happily.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:20.610
Just as the central government sends out officials to provinces,

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:24.540
I sometimes think it would be good if there were a system

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:28.380
that keeps doctors in contact to exchange information,
and provides a central meeting place.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:36.030
If you went there, you'd be able to meet all sorts of doctors,
and get to learn about various treatments.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:39.170
A place like that would have all types of medicines and equipment.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:49.070
Another doctor... might've been able to save them some other way.

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:54.080
What I can do alone is very limited.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:58.070
I'll take the national exam, become an official,

00:21:58.070 --> 00:21:58.960
and I'll...

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.550
I'll make Doushu-sama's wish come true!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.710
I will make your wish come true.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:15.120
To make sure fewer people will cry in the future...

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:23.260
Doushu-sama, our hope is in Shuurei-sama's and Yuushun-sama's hands now.

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:26.450
They will make our wish come true.

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:32.450
All I can do now is to try my best at saving as many lives as possible!

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:36.830
Hey, Eigetsu, aren't we fortunate?

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:38.960
Yes, Doushu-sama.

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:42.560
I have had... a really fortunate life!

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:15.380
Kokushuu Governor Kai, I presume?
